{"structured_output": {"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>分诊审核报告</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<style>\n  body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-800\">\n<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-6\">\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-700 to-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 mb-4 shadow-lg\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <div>\n        <h1 class=\"text-lg font-bold\">分诊审核报告</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm mt-1\">患者 P-20260419-001 · 2026-04-19 10:30</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <span class=\"bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold\">⚠️ 关注</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Patient Profile -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">👤</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">患者概况</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-1\">\n      <p><strong>长期档案：</strong>王建国，男，72岁。诊断：高血压（10年）、2型糖尿病（5年）、高脂血症。长期用药：氨氯地平 5mg qd、二甲双胍 500mg bid、阿托伐他汀 20mg qn。独居，生活基本自理。</p>\n      <p><strong>近期动态：</strong>近一周血压波动较大，收缩压在135-158mmHg之间；血糖控制尚可，空腹血糖6.2-7.1mmol/L；活动量较前两周有所下降，日均步数从3200步降至1800步。睡眠质量一般，夜间偶有起夜。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Signal Summary -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">📡</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">信号概览</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2\">窗口：2026-04-12 ~ 2026-04-19</div>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-rose-50 text-rose-700\">血压波动增大</span>\n<span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-rose-50 text-rose-700\">活动量持续下降</span>\n<span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-rose-50 text-rose-700\">血氧偶有轻度下降</span></div>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">过去7天手环数据显示心率平稳但活动量逐日下降，血氧偶有轻度下降（最低93%），血压波动增大。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Vitals -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">📊</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">最新体征</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-2\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center border border-slate-100\"><div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium mb-1\">血压</div><div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800\">152/92 <span class=\"text-[10px] font-normal text-slate-400\">mmHg</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center border border-slate-100\"><div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium mb-1\">心率</div><div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800\">76 <span class=\"text-[10px] font-normal text-slate-400\">bpm</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center border border-slate-100\"><div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium mb-1\">血氧</div><div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800\">95 <span class=\"text-[10px] font-normal text-slate-400\">%</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center border border-slate-100\"><div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium mb-1\">血糖</div><div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800\">6.8 <span class=\"text-[10px] font-normal text-slate-400\">mmol/L</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center border border-slate-100\"><div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium mb-1\">步数</div><div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800\">1200 <span class=\"text-[10px] font-normal text-slate-400\">步</span></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Triage Assessment -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">🏥</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">分诊评估</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\">\n      <span class=\"bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-700 border-yellow-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold border\">📋 次急</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n      <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2\">风险标签</div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-orange-50 text-orange-700\">血压波动增大</span>\n<span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-orange-50 text-orange-700\">活动量持续下降</span>\n<span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-orange-50 text-orange-700\">心率轻度波动</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">评估依据</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg p-3\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #f59e0b\">分诊判断为次急：血压虽未达危象标准（>180/120），但波动明显且超出目标值（<140/90），结合活动量持续下降，提示可能存在功能状态恶化趋势。患者独居，社会支持有限，跌倒和急性事件风险较普通患者更高。综合评估需24小时内随访。</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Recommendations -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">📋</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">临床建议</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">给医生</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-3\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #f59e0b\">该患者为72岁独居老人，合并高血压、2型糖尿病及高脂血症。近一周监测数据显示血压控制不佳，收缩压波动于135-158mmHg，今日测量152/92mmHg，超出目标值。同时活动量呈持续下降趋势，日均步数已降至1200步，需警惕心功能变化和情绪低落可能。血糖控制尚在可接受范围。建议近期安排门诊随访，评估降压方案调整必要性，并关注患者心理状态。</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">具体建议</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-2\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #3b82f6\">近期安排门诊随访，重点评估血压控制方案，考虑联合用药或调整剂量</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-2\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #3b82f6\">建议完善心电图和心脏超声检查，排除心功能恶化</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-2\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #3b82f6\">制定低强度室内运动方案，如每日椅子操15分钟，逐步恢复活动量</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-2\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #3b82f6\">加强血压自测频率，建议每日晨起和睡前各测一次并记录</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-2\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #3b82f6\">关注患者心理状态，活动量下降可能与情绪低落有关，必要时安排心理评估</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Nutrition Plan Summary -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\"><span class=\"text-lg\">🥗</span><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">营养方案摘要</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\">高血压</span><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\">2型糖尿病</span><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\">高脂血症</span></div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-1\">• 低钠饮食（每日<5g盐）</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-1\">• 控制精细碳水，增加全谷物比例</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-1\">• 减少饱和脂肪摄入，增加不饱和脂肪酸</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-1\">• 适量优质蛋白，每日1.0-1.2g/kg</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-3 mt-3\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #3b82f6\">已根据患者三种慢性病组合及偏好面食的习惯，生成个性化一周营养方案。建议逐步用全麦面食替代精白面食。</div></div>\n\n  <!-- Adherence -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\"><span class=\"text-lg\">💊</span><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">依从性分析</h2></div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">当前状态</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-purple-50 text-purple-700\">用药依从性良好</span><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-purple-50 text-purple-700\">饮食控制一般</span><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-purple-50 text-purple-700\">运动量不足</span></div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">偏好</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-blue-50 text-blue-600\">偏好面食</span><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-blue-50 text-blue-600\">不喜欢运动</span></div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">建议</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-2\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #6366f1\">建议将氨氯地平调整为晨服并考虑联合ARB类药物</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-2\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #6366f1\">推荐室内简易运动方案（如椅子操），降低外出运动的抗拒感</div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-2\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #6366f1\">安排营养师会诊，制定低钠低糖饮食方案</div></div>\n\n  <!-- Map -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">📍</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">患者位置</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-3\">患者近期活动量偏低，以下是附近推荐的公园和医疗网点，可建议患者适当外出活动。</p>\n    <div class=\"rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-slate-200\" style=\"height:240px\">\n      <iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border:0\"\n        src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=39.9042,116.4074&z=15&output=embed\"\n        allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Guardrail -->\n  <div class=\"bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6\">\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-amber-800 leading-relaxed\">本报告由 AI 健康助手自动生成，仅供临床参考辅助决策，不构成医疗诊断或处方建议。最终临床决策请结合患者实际情况，以主治医师判断为准。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-center text-xs text-slate-400 pb-6\">AI 健康助手 · 临床辅助报告 · 仅供参考</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "detail": {"patient_profile": {"name": "王建国", "age": 72, "gender": "男", "diagnoses": ["高血压", "2型糖尿病", "高脂血症"], "medications": ["氨氯地平 5mg qd", "二甲双胍 500mg bid", "阿托伐他汀 20mg qn"], "baseline_note": "独居老人，生活基本自理，认知功能正常"}, "patient_status": "at_risk", "triage_level": "semi_urgent", "risk_tags": ["血压波动增大", "活动量持续下降", "心率轻度波动"], "assistant_message_doctor": "该患者为72岁独居老人，合并高血压、2型糖尿病及高脂血症。近一周监测数据显示血压控制不佳，收缩压波动于135-158mmHg，今日测量152/92mmHg，超出目标值。同时活动量呈持续下降趋势，日均步数已降至1200步，需警惕心功能变化和情绪低落可能。血糖控制尚在可接受范围。建议近期安排门诊随访，评估降压方案调整必要性，并关注患者心理状态。", "reasoning": "分诊判断为次急：血压虽未达危象标准（>180/120），但波动明显且超出目标值（<140/90），结合活动量持续下降，提示可能存在功能状态恶化趋势。患者独居，社会支持有限，跌倒和急性事件风险较普通患者更高。综合评估需24小时内随访。", "signals_summary": {"window": "2026-04-12 ~ 2026-04-19", "description": "过去7天手环数据显示心率平稳但活动量逐日下降，血氧偶有轻度下降（最低93%），血压波动增大。", "anomalies": ["血压波动增大", "活动量持续下降", "血氧偶有轻度下降"]}, "latest_vitals": {"blood_pressure": "152/92", "heart_rate": 76, "blood_oxygen": 95, "blood_glucose": 6.8, "steps": 1200}, "adherence_analysis": {"statuses": ["用药依从性良好", "饮食控制一般", "运动量不足"], "preferences": ["偏好面食", "不喜欢运动"], "interventions": ["评估降压药物方案调整", "制定个性化低强度运动方案"], "suggestions": ["建议将氨氯地平调整为晨服并考虑联合ARB类药物", "推荐室内简易运动方案（如椅子操），降低外出运动的抗拒感", "安排营养师会诊，制定低钠低糖饮食方案"]}, "recommendations": ["近期安排门诊随访，重点评估血压控制方案，考虑联合用药或调整剂量", "建议完善心电图和心脏超声检查，排除心功能恶化", "制定低强度室内运动方案，如每日椅子操15分钟，逐步恢复活动量", "加强血压自测频率，建议每日晨起和睡前各测一次并记录", "关注患者心理状态，活动量下降可能与情绪低落有关，必要时安排心理评估"], "nutrition_plan_summary": {"conditions_addressed": ["高血压", "2型糖尿病", "高脂血症"], "diet_principles": ["低钠饮食（每日<5g盐）", "控制精细碳水，增加全谷物比例", "减少饱和脂肪摄入，增加不饱和脂肪酸", "适量优质蛋白，每日1.0-1.2g/kg"], "weekly_plan_generated": true, "plan_note": "已根据患者三种慢性病组合及偏好面食的习惯，生成个性化一周营养方案。建议逐步用全麦面食替代精白面食。"}, "guardrail": "本报告由 AI 健康助手自动生成，仅供临床参考辅助决策，不构成医疗诊断或处方建议。最终临床决策请结合患者实际情况，以主治医师判断为准。"}}}